.TH "user:password:reset" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
user:password:reset \- Resets the password for a user account.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php user:password:reset
\fIusername\fR [\-\-password=\fIPASS\fR] [\-\-json] [\-\-app=\fIAPP\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Updates the user's password hash in the framework authentication database.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-password =\fIPASS\fR
New plaintext password.
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Outputs results in structured JSON format.
.TP
.BR \-\-app =\fIAPP\fR
Targets a specific application context.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Validates user existence, hashes the new password with bcrypt, and updates spp_users.
